---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" backLabel="TF Unions" backHref="/">
  <!-- Asymmetric 12-Col Institutional Profile -->
  <section class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
    <!-- Left 4 Cols: Deep Oxford Navy Dossier -->
    <aside class="lg:col-span-4 bg-[#0A1931] text-white border border-[#1E3A6D] rounded-lg p-7 shadow-[0_3px_12px_rgba(10,25,49,0.08)]">
      <div class="inline-block pl-3 border-l-2 border-[#C88A14] text-[13px] font-medium text-[#E2E8F0]">
        Institutional dossier
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-[34px] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-white">
        About TF Unions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#CBD5E1]">
        Formerly Altafawwoq Union. An independent, student-governed educational foundation operating across all 27 Egyptian governorates.
      </p>

      <dl class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-[#1E3A6D] space-y-4 text-[13px]">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[#94A3B8]">Founding Cohort</dt>
          <dd class="font-semibold text-white mt-0.5">October 2025</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[#94A3B8]">Founders</dt>
          <dd class="font-semibold text-white mt-0.5">Mohammed Farag &amp; Mohammed Abdelghany</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[#94A3B8]">Infrastructure Model</dt>
          <dd class="font-semibold text-[#4ADE80] mt-0.5">Self-hosted PostgreSQL &amp; Open APIs ($0 SaaS)</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-[#1E3A6D] flex flex-col gap-2">
        <a href="/team" class="h-10 px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-between rounded-md bg-[#C88A14] hover:bg-[#B2790E] text-[#0A1931] text-[13px] font-bold transition">
          <span>Inspect 71-Member Constellation</span>
          <span>›</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/charter" class="h-10 px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-between rounded-md bg-[#102447] hover:bg-[#1E3A6D] border border-[#1E3A6D] text-white text-[13px] font-semibold transition">
          <span>Read Non-Profit Charter</span>
          <span>›</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- Right 8 Cols: Crisp Paper Mandate & Principles -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
      <article class="bg-white border border-[#CFCBC2] rounded-lg p-7 sm:p-9 shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(10,25,49,0.04)]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[28px] font-bold text-[#12161F]">Answer before they ask</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-[#4A5262] max-w-[68ch]">
          Most ambitious high school and university students in Egypt lose critical scholarship deadlines, Olympiad training plans, or research mentors simply because information sits scattered across private chats. TF Unions centralizes admissions intelligence, scientific writing guides, and chapter networks into open, fast, permanent public infrastructure.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 pt-6 border-t border-[#CFCBC2] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-md bg-[#ECEAE4] border border-[#CFCBC2]">
            <h3 class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-[#12161F]">Every educational track included</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A5262]">
              Thanaweya Amma, STEM High Schools, IGCSE, American Diploma, Al-Azhar, Preparatory schools, and universities share identical free access.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-md bg-[#ECEAE4] border border-[#CFCBC2]">
            <h3 class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-[#12161F]">Built for long-term memory</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A5262]">
              Research blueprinted by alumni cohorts remains online permanently so each incoming class starts ahead of the previous one.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <section class="bg-white border border-[#CFCBC2] rounded-lg p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_2px_6px_rgba(10,25,49,0.04)]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[24px] font-bold text-[#12161F] pb-3 border-b border-[#CFCBC2]">
          Operating commitments
        </h2>
        <div class="divide-y divide-[#E2DFD7]">
          <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold text-[#12161F]">Ambition over examination cutoffs</div>
              <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#4A5262] mt-0.5">Opportunity access is determined by curiosity, build logs, and initiative rather than geography or school track.</div>
            </div>
            <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#E2DFD7] border border-[#C8C3B8] text-[#12161F] shrink-0">Principle 1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold text-[#12161F]">Zero recurring commercial SaaS lock-in</div>
              <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#4A5262] mt-0.5">Databases, SSO authentication, analytics, and automated workflows run on dedicated Linux containers controlled by the union.</div>
            </div>
            <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#E2DFD7] border border-[#C8C3B8] text-[#12161F] shrink-0">Principle 2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold text-[#12161F]">Verifiable public accountability</div>
              <div class="text-[13.5px] text-[#4A5262] mt-0.5">Volunteer certificates carry public serials and all inflows/outflows are audited on the Open Ledger.</div>
            </div>
            <span class="font-code text-[12px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#E2DFD7] border border-[#C8C3B8] text-[#12161F] shrink-0">Principle 3</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
